# v0.201.0-beta Release Notes

Release: v0.201.0-beta
Date: 2026-08-17
Tag: v0.201.0-beta

## Product `ooda/std`

- `oodac check` on all 402 tracked modules: 402 OK.
- Typecheck fixes: bind struct fields to a `Bool` local before `if`
  (`base64`, `small_vec`, `async_write`, `indent_formatter`, `regex`,
  `channel_mpsc`, `net_error`, `quic_packet`, `simd_matrix4x4`).
- `statistics_binned.oo`: convert bin count 2/3/4 to Float for width.
- `hash/sha256.oo` forwards to `crypto_sha256_internal`.
- Proved emit+gcc+run: `open78_base64.oo`, `prove_prod_smallvec.oo`,
  `prove_prod_indent.oo`, `prove_prod_binned.oo`, `prove_prod_sha256.oo`.
- Still broken: `prove_prod_awrite.oo` (`FAIL awrite buf`).
  `std/text/regex.oo` emit-c hangs. Full 180-prove census not re-run.

## Org `std/`

- `crypto/hkdf.oo` combined `hkdf()` extract+expand. Prove:
  `prove_hkdf.oo` RFC 4231 extract + RFC 5869 A.1 OKM.
- Large destub rewrite under `src/ooda/` (thousands of files).
  Check-only on samples. Not a 4000-file emit+gcc+run stamp.
- AES-GCM, Kyber, x25519, curve25519, argon2 still `process_exit(1)`.

## Pin

- CLI `ooda version` prints `0.201.0-beta`.
- `install/BOOTSTRAP_PIN`, `std.pin`, `ooda.pkg`, install layout default
  match `v0.201.0-beta`.

## Residual

- `List[Float]` emit, untyped struct-as-`long long`, PQC/FHE, device GPU,
  public install pause. Same as ROADMAP leftover list.
